<title>JAPAN: Japan Jan service price index falls 0.7% yr/yr-BOJ.</title>
<headline>Japan Jan service price index falls 0.7% yr/yr-BOJ.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's corporate service price index (CSPI) fell 0.7 percent in January from a year earlier, and dropped 0.1 percent from a month earlier, the Bank of Japan (BOJ) said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The overall index stood at 101.5 for January. The index tracks price movements in the service industry and uses 1990 as its base year.</p>
<p>The following are percentage changes in components of the index year-on-year (Y-Y) and month-on-month (M-M):</p>
<p>			    JAN Y-Y    M-M	 DEC  Y-Y   M-M</p>
<p> Finance/Insurance     -0.1  0.1	    -0.2  0.0</p>
<p> Real estate	     -1.5  0.0	    -1.8  0.0</p>
<p> Transport		 -0.3 +0.3	    +0.4 -0.5</p>
<p> Information services   0.0  0.0	     0.0  0.0</p>
<p> Communications	  -1.2  0.0	    -1.2 -0.1</p>
<p> Advertising services  +1.4 -1.8	    +1.5 -1.0</p>
<p> Lease/rental services -5.6 -0.4	    -5.2 -0.3</p>
<p> Other services	  +0.6  0.0	    +0.5 +0.0</p>
</text>
